{"id":"moral","lemma":"moral","pos":"adj","rank":2020,"glosses":["moral","incorporeal"],"ipa":"/mɔ.ʁal/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bd/Fr-moral.ogg/Fr-moral.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"morale","masculinePlural":"moraux","femininePlural":"morales"},"formAudio":{"morale":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-morale.wav","moraux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-moraux.wav","morales":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Roptat-morales.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est bon pour le moral.","en":"It's good for morale.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je veux te remonter le moral.","en":"I want to cheer you up.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to go back up"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Il a le moral très bas.","en":"He's feeling really low.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"very"},{"g":"low"}]},{"text":"Essayez de garder le moral.","en":"Try to keep up your spirits.","words":[{"g":"to test, to try on","l":"essayer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to keep"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Le moral de ces hommes était excellent.","en":"The morale of those men was excellent.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"man","l":"homme"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"excellent"}]}]}